                                "ru": "Ваша <w>доставка</w> лежит на столе в прихожей.",
                                "tr": "<w>Paketiniz</w> koridordaki masanın üzerinde."
                            }
                        },
                        {
                            "text": "The driver left the <w>delivery</w> with a neighbor because you were out.",
